+# Password Hashing
+
+This project's current recorded decision is to use Argon2id for password hashing across the system. Argon2id was chosen for its resistance to GPU- and ASIC-based cracking, since it is both memory-hard and time-hard. No specific parameter values (memory cost, iterations, parallelism) are recorded.
